    "Decoded ahead on each side of the current page. Higher values turn pages faster but use more memory.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Decoded ahead on each side of the current page. Higher values turn pages faster but use more memory."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "現在のページの前後それぞれで、あらかじめ展開しておくページ数です。増やすとページ送りが速くなりますが、メモリを多く使います。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Decoded pages near the one you are reading stay in memory so that turning back is instant. This is the limit per open book. Larger values turn pages faster after going back; smaller values use less memory.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Decoded pages near the one you are reading stay in memory so that turning back is instant. This is the limit per open book. Larger values turn pages faster after going back; smaller values use less memory."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "読んでいるページの前後のページをメモリに残しておき、戻ったときに即座に表示できるようにします。開いている本1冊あたりの上限です。大きくすると戻ったときのページ送りが速くなり、小さくするとメモリの使用量が減ります。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
