            "state": "translated",
            "value": "既存のファイルを上書きしますか?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Overwrite replaces existing data for the books mentioned in the file. Merge only adds what's missing, without changing anything that already exists. Ignore skips that category entirely.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Overwrite replaces existing data for the books mentioned in the file. Merge only adds what's missing, without changing anything that already exists. Ignore skips that category entirely."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "「上書き」はファイルに含まれる本の既存データを置き換えます。「マージ」は既存のデータを変更せず、足りないものだけを追加します。「無視」はその種類を取り込みません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "PDF files can't store spread/reading-direction layout information. Bookmarks and title/author are exported, but the spread and reading-direction settings will be lost.": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "PDF files can't store spread/reading-direction layout information. Bookmarks and title/author are exported, but the spread and reading-direction settings will be lost."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "PDFファイルには見開き・読み方向のレイアウト情報を保存できません。ブックマークとタイトル・著者名は書き出されますが、見開き・読み方向の設定は失われます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
