          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "選んでいる表示モードについて、この画面のすべての設定を初期状態に戻します。ほかの表示モードや設定には影響しません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Restores every setting on this page, except Books to Keep Data For and Recent Files to Keep — lowering those would discard data you have already saved. Other pages, and your favorites, bookmarks and reading history, are not affected.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Restores every setting on this page, except Books to Keep Data For and Recent Files to Keep — lowering those would discard data you have already saved. Other pages, and your favorites, bookmarks and reading history, are not affected."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "「データを保持する本の数」と「履歴の保存件数」を除いて、この画面のすべての設定を初期状態に戻します(この2つは、下げると保存済みのデータがその場で消えるため戻しません)。ほかの画面の設定と、お気に入り・ブックマーク・読書履歴には影響しません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Restores every setting on this page, including the color of every frosted surface. Other pages are not affected.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Restores every setting on this page, including the color of every frosted surface. Other pages are not affected."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "この画面のすべての設定を初期状態に戻します(すりガラスの各面の色を含む)。ほかの画面の設定には影響しません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Restores every setting on this page, which turns the thumbnail disk cache off and deletes it. Other pages, and your favorites, bookmarks and reading history, are not affected.": {
      "localizations": {
