    "Your favorites, bookmarks, and reading history couldn't be loaded, possibly because they're incompatible with this version of qooViewer.\n\nIf you continue, all of this data will be permanently deleted and qooViewer will start fresh. If you don't want to lose this data, quit now without deleting it (for example, to try an older version of qooViewer, or to ask for help).": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your favorites, bookmarks, and reading history couldn't be loaded, possibly because they're incompatible with this version of qooViewer.\n\nIf you continue, all of this data will be permanently deleted and qooViewer will start fresh. If you don't want to lose this data, quit now without deleting it (for example, to try an older version of qooViewer, or to ask for help)."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "お気に入り・ブックマーク・読書履歴を読み込めませんでした。このバージョンのqooViewerと互換性が無い可能性があります。\n\n続行すると、これらのデータはすべて完全に削除され、qooViewerはまっさらな状態から起動し直します。データを失いたくない場合は、削除せずに今すぐ終了してください(例: 別のバージョンのqooViewerを試す、サポートに相談する、など)。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "qooViewer Can't Open Your Saved Data": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "qooViewer Can't Open Your Saved Data"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "保存されたデータを開けません"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "qooViewer Could Not Start": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "qooViewer Could Not Start"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "qooViewerを起動できませんでした"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "qooViewer Library.json": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "qooViewer Library.json"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "qooViewer Library.json"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "qooViewer can only reach files you opened yourself. Granting a folder lets “Previous Book” and “Next Book” find the other files next to a book you opened directly. Access is remembered after you quit.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "qooViewer can only reach files you opened yourself. Granting a folder lets “Previous Book” and “Next Book” find the other files next to a book you opened directly. Access is remembered after you quit."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "qooViewerは、あなたが自分で開いたファイルにしかアクセスできません。フォルダを許可しておくと、ファイルを直接開いた場合でも「前の本」「次の本」が同じフォルダ内の他のファイルを見つけられます。許可は終了後も記憶されます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "qooViewer couldn't start even after resetting its saved data. Please contact support.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "qooViewer couldn't start even after resetting its saved data. Please contact support."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "保存データをリセットしても起動できませんでした。サポートにお問い合わせください。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "qooViewer detected that this book's files may have changed since its saved layout settings (reading direction, page order, single/spread page settings) were recorded. Keep the existing settings, or discard them and start fresh?": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "qooViewer detected that this book's files may have changed since its saved layout settings (reading direction, page order, single/spread page settings) were recorded. Keep the existing settings, or discard them and start fresh?"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "この本のファイルが、レイアウト設定(読み方向・ページ順・単独/見開きページの設定)を記録した時点から変わっている可能性があります。既存の設定を維持しますか、それとも破棄してやり直しますか?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "qooViewer doesn't have permission to check this location, so it can't tell whether the file still exists. Granting access to the folder in Settings › Access, or connecting the volume, will let it check.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "qooViewer doesn't have permission to check this location, so it can't tell whether the file still exists. Granting access to the folder in Settings › Access, or connecting the volume, will let it check."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "この場所を確認する権限が無いため、ファイルが残っているかどうかを判定できません。環境設定の「アクセス権」でフォルダを許可するか、ボリュームを接続すると判定できるようになります。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "qooViewer is still checking whether the original file or folder exists.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "qooViewer is still checking whether the original file or folder exists."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "元のファイル/フォルダが存在するかどうかを確認しています。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "qooViewer isn't storing data for any book yet.": {
